title: loadPhase
---
<<declare $dialogPhase = "">>

<<setPhase NPC>>

<<if $dialogPhase == "begin">>
    <<jump Start>>
<<elseif $dialogPhase == "comeback">>
    <<jump CheckForPhone>>
<<elseif $dialogPhase == "quest_completed">>
    <<jump RewardNode>>
<<else>>
    <<jump CheckForPhone>>
<<endif>>
===

title: Start
---
Nicholas: Hello it is me your professor Nicholas 
Nicholas: I forgot my computer at the top of the parkour mountain
Nicholas: Can u get it I will give you an A if you do 
-> Yes, I will find it.
    <<getPhase NPC "comeback">>  
    Nicholas: Thank you I will wait here at home
-> No, look for it yourself.
    Nicholas: Ok well then I give you an F 
===

title: CheckForPhone
---
Nicholas: Do you have my computer?
Nicholas: No? why are you still here then?
===

title: RewardNode
---
Nicholas: OMG my computer
Nicholas: Thank you so much for bringing it back into the house for me.
Nicholas: But actually I'm not gonna give you an A for that because 
Nicholas: Academic integrity is important 


===
